{"4983550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon One-Man Army", "steam_appid": 4983550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE MOMENTUM, HIGH AUTONOMY, UNSTOPPABLE ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The floor is your enemy.</strong> Immerse yourself in a futuristic, vertical world drenched in vibrant neon lights. You command two distinct forces: a high-velocity <strong>Grappling Gun</strong> in one hand to swing through the skyline like an apex predator, and a devastating arsenal of <strong>weapons</strong> in the other to turn rogue robots into scrap metal. If you stop moving, you die. Keep your momentum, stay airborne, and find your flow!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Infinite Momentum &amp; Fluid Movement:</strong> Master physics-based grappling mechanics to soar between platforms without losing speed. The ground is merely a pit stop—touch down for a split second to recharge your stamina, then launch yourself straight back into the stratosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/c8fc226293b5f73092456cba1777a796.poster.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/c8fc226293b5f73092456cba1777a796.webm?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/c8fc226293b5f73092456cba1777a796.mp4?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Hypnotic Neon Aesthetics &amp; Stress Relief:</strong> Visually striking, non-intrusive neon environments combined with a rhythmic gameplay loop create the ultimate &quot;flow state.&quot; It's intense, fast-paced action designed to let you blow off steam and shred enemies effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/4738ba6c23bb03317fd51456f1d38d6d.poster.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/4738ba6c23bb03317fd51456f1d38d6d.webm?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/4738ba6c23bb03317fd51456f1d38d6d.mp4?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Elite Skill Chests:</strong> Pulling the trigger isn't enough; you need to dominate. Reach specific kill milestones to unlock high-tier chests packed with game-changing active skills that will melt through enemy ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/56507a46be3cc1a2b5b484309315745e.poster.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/56507a46be3cc1a2b5b484309315745e.webm?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/56507a46be3cc1a2b5b484309315745e.mp4?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Dynamic Card Draft System:</strong> Adapt and evolve on the fly. Choose from specialized upgrade cards every time you level up to boost your firepower, extend your grappling reach, or push your mobility past its limits. Craft the perfect build for every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/47c107c5322aab29401f3203b1c953f8.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing &amp; Shoot:</strong> Staying airborne is your best defense. Line up your shots and blast mechanical threats while swinging mid-air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt &amp; Evolve:</strong> Select strategic upgrade cards as you level up, combining passive traits into powerful combat combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash the Chests:</strong> Fill your kill counter, unlock tactical skill chests, and watch the arena dissolve into neon sparks.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE MOMENTUM, HIGH AUTONOMY, UNSTOPPABLE ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The floor is your enemy.</strong> Immerse yourself in a futuristic, vertical world drenched in vibrant neon lights. You command two distinct forces: a high-velocity <strong>Grappling Gun</strong> in one hand to swing through the skyline like an apex predator, and a devastating arsenal of <strong>weapons</strong> in the other to turn rogue robots into scrap metal. If you stop moving, you die. Keep your momentum, stay airborne, and find your flow!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Infinite Momentum &amp; Fluid Movement:</strong> Master physics-based grappling mechanics to soar between platforms without losing speed. The ground is merely a pit stop—touch down for a split second to recharge your stamina, then launch yourself straight back into the stratosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/c8fc226293b5f73092456cba1777a796.poster.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/c8fc226293b5f73092456cba1777a796.webm?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/c8fc226293b5f73092456cba1777a796.mp4?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Hypnotic Neon Aesthetics &amp; Stress Relief:</strong> Visually striking, non-intrusive neon environments combined with a rhythmic gameplay loop create the ultimate &quot;flow state.&quot; It's intense, fast-paced action designed to let you blow off steam and shred enemies effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/4738ba6c23bb03317fd51456f1d38d6d.poster.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/4738ba6c23bb03317fd51456f1d38d6d.webm?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/4738ba6c23bb03317fd51456f1d38d6d.mp4?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Elite Skill Chests:</strong> Pulling the trigger isn't enough; you need to dominate. Reach specific kill milestones to unlock high-tier chests packed with game-changing active skills that will melt through enemy ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/56507a46be3cc1a2b5b484309315745e.poster.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/56507a46be3cc1a2b5b484309315745e.webm?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/56507a46be3cc1a2b5b484309315745e.mp4?t=1788351882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Dynamic Card Draft System:</strong> Adapt and evolve on the fly. Choose from specialized upgrade cards every time you level up to boost your firepower, extend your grappling reach, or push your mobility past its limits. Craft the perfect build for every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983550/extras/47c107c5322aab29401f3203b1c953f8.avif?t=1788351882\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing &amp; Shoot:</strong> Staying airborne is your best defense. Line up your shots and blast mechanical threats while swinging mid-air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt &amp; Evolve:</strong> Select strategic upgrade cards as you level up, combining passive traits into powerful combat combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash the Chests:</strong> Fill your kill counter, unlock tactical skill chests, and watch the arena dissolve into neon sparks.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "High-speed neon action! Swing with your grappling gun, blast rogue robots, and stay airborne. Shoot while flying, chain movement and combat, and feel the rush of unstoppable momentum. Choose powerful cards, unlock skill chests, and master your movement to become an unstoppable force.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "ht